{"t":"Stonehome","s":"stonehome-63af6","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Stonehome_map_e34160.png","q":4,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Stonehome</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Stonehome map\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stonehome_map_e34160.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Daniel%20Steelsoul\">Daniel Steelsoul</a> (ordered by <a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Tibianus\">King Tibianus</a>)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Bog%20Raider%20Cave\">Edron Bog Raider Cave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Forgotten%20Tomb\">Forgotten Tomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grimvale\">Grimvale</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.4<br/>November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Stonehome</b> is a small village north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33303,31773,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33303, 31773, 7)</a>).\n</p><p>Stonehome is a good place to train whether in the south areas or the north. In the north you will always have plenty of food dropped by the usual <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabbit\">rabbits</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\">deer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sheep\">sheep</a> and by training monsters such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>. Look out for <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, too.\n</p><p>There is a small cave next to Stonehome Flats that contains <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\">Carrion Worms</a> on deeper levels and at the southern end of the first level a single spawn of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guard</a> in a separate second level room, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bog%20Raider\">Bog Raiders</a> also spawn in the deeper parts of the cave. In addition, there is a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a> spawn atop a hill north of Stonehome.\n</p><p>At the Stonehome Cemetary (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33314,31737,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33314, 31737, 7)</a>), you can dig up a burial vault featuring a single skeleton and its coffin, and behind that rock you can dig up the entrance to a cave where you will meet a few more <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">skeletons</a> and some <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">scorpions</a> on a deeper level.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Stonehome NPCs (8 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Albert\">Albert</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Albert\"><img alt=\"Albert\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Albert_a8556b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Healer</td><td style=\"widt