;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">Just south-west of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Stonehome</strong>, in his house</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Telas%20Golem\">Telas Golem</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Telas%20Golem\"><img alt=\"Telas Golem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Telas_Golem_1b28be.gif\" width=\"89\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">Below the house of <a href=\"#/wiki/Telas\">Telas</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["elementalist-outfits-quest","fire-axe-quest","shadows-of-yalahar-quest","their-masters-voice-world-change"]}